{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d4e5f6a7-b8c9-0123-def0-345678901234",
    "name": "Baby Go — Settings",
    "description": "Settings por `code` + JSON.\n\n**GET /v1/settings** público → `{ items: [{ id, code, value, createdAt, updatedAt }] }`\n**GET /v1/settings/:code** público → un documento. 404 `settings_not_found`.\n**POST /v1/settings** JWT → `{ code, value }`. 409 `settings_code_exists`.\n**PATCH /v1/settings/:code** JWT → `{ value }` reemplaza el JSON.\n\nEl seeder crea `supported-countries` (array `{ code, phoneCode }`) y `product-taxonomy` (`{ families: [...] }`).\n`code`: empieza con letra, letras/números/_/- , se guarda lowercase.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "settingCode",
      "value": "supported-countries"
    },
    {
      "key": "productTaxonomyCode",
      "value": "product-taxonomy"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Settings",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Listar todas (público)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/settings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "settings"]
            },
            "description": "Público. `{ items: [{ id, code, value }] }`. El front toma `code` y usa GET by code o lee `value` acá."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Get by code (público)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/settings/{{settingCode}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "settings", "{{settingCode}}"]
            },
            "description": "Público. Ej. `supported-countries` → `{ code, value: [{ code, phoneCode }] }` o `product-taxonomy`. 404 `settings_not_found`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2b. Get product-taxonomy (público)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/settings/{{productTaxonomyCode}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "settings", "{{productTaxonomyCode}}"]
            },
            "description": "Público. `value.families[]` con categorías y atributos para el form dinámico de productos."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Crear setting (JWT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"feature-flags\",\n  \"value\": {\n    \"bundlesEnabled\": true,\n    \"maxProductPhotos\": 8\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/settings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "settings"]
            },
            "description": "Bearer. `{ code, value }` (value = object o array JSON). 409 `settings_code_exists` si el code ya está."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3b. Crear supported-countries (si no hay seeder)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"supported-countries\",\n  \"value\": [\n    { \"code\": \"NL\", \"phoneCode\": \"+31\" },\n    { \"code\": \"ES\", \"phoneCode\": \"+34\" },\n    { \"code\": \"IT\", \"phoneCode\": \"+39\" },\n    { \"code\": \"DE\", \"phoneCode\": \"+49\" },\n    { \"code\": \"BE\", \"phoneCode\": \"+32\" },\n    { \"code\": \"UK\", \"phoneCode\": \"+44\" },\n    { \"code\": \"PT\", \"phoneCode\": \"+351\" },\n    { \"code\": \"FR\", \"phoneCode\": \"+33\" },\n    { \"code\": \"CL\", \"phoneCode\": \"+56\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/settings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "settings"]
            },
            "description": "El seeder ya crea este code al boot. Si existe → 409."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3c. Crear product-taxonomy (si no hay seeder)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"product-taxonomy\",\n  \"value\": {\n    \"families\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"mobility\",\n        \"label\": \"Movilidad\",\n        \"description\": \"Cochecitos, sistemas de viaje y bicis.\",\n        \"categories\": [\n          {\n            \"id\": \"stroller\",\n            \"label\": \"Cochecitos\",\n            \"attributes\": [\n              {\n                \"key\": \"ageRange\",\n                \"label\": \"Rango de edad\",\n                \"type\": \"range\",\n                \"required\": true,\n                \"min\": 0,\n                \"max\": 72\n              },\n              {\n                \"key\": \"foldable\",\n                \"label\": \"Plegable\",\n                \"type\": \"boolean\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/settings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "settings"]
            },
            "description": "Bearer. El seeder ya crea el JSON completo. Si existe → 409. Para reemplazar usá PATCH."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Patch setting (JWT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"value\": [\n    { \"code\": \"NL\", \"phoneCode\": \"+31\" },\n    { \"code\": \"ES\", \"phoneCode\": \"+34\" },\n    { \"code\": \"IT\", \"phoneCode\": \"+39\" },\n    { \"code\": \"DE\", \"phoneCode\": \"+49\" },\n    { \"code\": \"BE\", \"phoneCode\": \"+32\" },\n    { \"code\": \"UK\", \"phoneCode\": \"+44\" },\n    { \"code\": \"PT\", \"phoneCode\": \"+351\" },\n    { \"code\": \"FR\", \"phoneCode\": \"+33\" },\n    { \"code\": \"CL\", \"phoneCode\": \"+56\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/settings/{{settingCode}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "settings", "{{settingCode}}"]
            },
            "description": "Bearer. Reemplaza `value` completo del code. 404 `settings_not_found`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4b. Patch product-taxonomy (JWT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"value\": {\n    \"families\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"mobility\",\n        \"label\": \"Movilidad\",\n        \"description\": \"Cochecitos, sistemas de viaje y bicis.\",\n        \"categories\": [\n          {\n            \"id\": \"stroller\",\n            \"label\": \"Cochecitos\",\n            \"attributes\": [\n              {\n                \"key\": \"ageRange\",\n                \"label\": \"Rango de edad\",\n                \"type\": \"range\",\n                \"required\": true,\n                \"min\": 0,\n                \"max\": 72\n              },\n              {\n                \"key\": \"foldable\",\n                \"label\": \"Plegable\",\n                \"type\": \"boolean\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/settings/{{productTaxonomyCode}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "settings", "{{productTaxonomyCode}}"]
            },
            "description": "Bearer. Reemplaza el JSON de familias/categorías/atributos. El front lee este value en el alta de producto."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
